# Used by `docker build -f Tools/Relay/Dockerfile .` so the build context is the relay and two library files,
# not the whole workspace (scenes, journals, disposable test copies, build output).
*
!Tools/Relay/**
!Libraries/collaboration/Editor/Core/RelayProtocol.cs
!Libraries/collaboration/Editor/Core/InviteCode.cs
Tools/Relay/bin
Tools/Relay/obj
Tools/Relay/.env
